<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9768" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντήρης</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντεφ-άρης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>, poet. Adj.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>set over against, opposite,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαβεῖν τινὰ ἀντήρη</span> meet <i>face
				to face</i> in battle, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				754
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1367
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντήρεις στέρνων πληγάς</span>
			blows <i>on the breast,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				89
			</span></i>: c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Φοινίκας ἀ. χώρα</span>
			<i>over against, facing</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				221
			</span></i> (lyr.): c. dat., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινί</span>
			<i>opposite to</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>IA</u>
				224
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ὄψεσι,</span> of the bat,
				<i>hostile to,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				747
			</span></i> (lyr.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
